"#CdmQuery- Scoped#CdmQuery - substituteVariable\\(Boolean substitute\\)#{3}":[1540,1541],"#CdmQuery- Scoped#CdmQuery - substituteVariable\\(Boolean substitute\\)#{4}":[1542,1668],"#CdmQuery- Scoped#CdmQuery - useCache\\(Boolean useCache\\)":[1669,1717],"#CdmQuery- Scoped#CdmQuery - useCache\\(Boolean useCache\\)#{1}":[1671,1696],"#CdmQuery- Scoped#CdmQuery - useCache\\(Boolean useCache\\)#{2}":[1697,1697],"#CdmQuery- Scoped#CdmQuery - useCache\\(Boolean useCache\\)#{3}":[1698,1699],"#CdmQuery- Scoped#CdmQuery - useCache\\(Boolean useCache\\)#{4}":[1700,1717]},"outlinks":[{"title":"CdmQuery - snapshotId\\(String snapshotSysID\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/CdmQueryScopedAPI.md","line":34},{"title":"CdmQuery - query\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/CdmQueryScopedAPI.md","line":38},{"title":"CdmQuery - forEach\\(Function function\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/CdmQueryScopedAPI.md","line":41},{"title":"CdmQuery - getTree\\(Boolean simpleTree, Boolean prettify\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/CdmQueryScopedAPI.md","line":42},{"title":"CdmQuery - getValue\\(String fieldName\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/CdmQueryScopedAPI.md","line":43},{"title":"CdmQuery - next\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/CdmQueryScopedAPI.md","line":44},{"title":"CdmQuery - decryptPassword\\(Boolean decrypt\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/CdmQueryScopedAPI.md","line":46},{"title":"CdmQuery - followIncludes\\(Boolean followIncludes\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/CdmQueryScopedAPI.md","line":47},{"title":"CdmQuery - includeFileMetadata\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/CdmQueryScopedAPI.md","line":48},{"title":"CdmQuery - substituteVariable\\(Boolean substitute\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/CdmQueryScopedAPI.md","line":49},{"title":"CdmQuery - useCache\\(Boolean useCache\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/CdmQueryScopedAPI.md","line":50},{"title":"Server API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/api-server.md","line":67},{"title":"CdmQuery - getTree\\(Boolean simpleTree, Boolean prettify\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/CdmQueryScopedAPI.md","line":1061}],"metadata":{"title":"CdmQuery - Scoped","description":"The CdmQuery script include provides methods that enable you to query the CDM data model tree. It returns a list of node objects that are specific fields/columns in the CDM Node \\[sn\\_cdm\\_node\\] table. These values are returned as properties in the object. Every object is a node in the data model.Instantiates a CdmQuery object. You must call this method prior to calling any other CdmQuery methods.Enables you to specify whether decrypted values for encrypted configuration data item \\(CDI\\) and variable nodes are returned in the results.Enables you to specify whether linked nodes are fully resolved, such that descendant nodes of a referenced node appear under a linked node.Iterates through each of the result nodes and applies the provided function that accepts a CdmNode object.Returns the specified CDM query results.Returns the value of the specified field of the current iterated node result.Enables you to specify whether to fetch the file metadata information for file nodes. The file metadata contains attachment\\_id, file\\_name, content\\_type, and checksum.Iterates to the next node result and returns it if it exists.Executes the specified query against the CDM database or the cache based on the settings, entry node, and filter settings.Specifies the entry node. The CdmQuery API limits its query to the entry node and its descendant nodes. Calling this method is mandatory.Enables you to specify whether to substitute variable references in configuration data item \\(CDI\\) nodes with the value of the referenced variable node.Enables you to specify whether to retrieve data from the cache, if any, instead of querying the database.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/CdmQueryScopedAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":19,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[56,63],[79,85],[129,137],[141,166],[170,178],[182,207],[249,255],[259,498],[502,508],[512,617],[633,637],[698,705],[709,712],[716,723],[727,752],[756,763],[767,1006],[1022,1040],[1044,1055],[1073,1079],[1083,1133],[1162,1179],[1183,1194],[1210,1216],[1220,1340],[1379,1385],[1389,1509],[1551,1559],[1563,1607],[1611,1619],[1623,1667],[1709,1715]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/CdmQueryScopedAPI.md"},
